  lines:
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, this household's Emotional Stability Index has fallen below
      the warning threshold.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb363f8a513a7d54ca37a97dc50a1860, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: At the current trajectory, without companion support, Ben and Claire are
      projected to separate within two weeks.
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 661c21ec264a21942ad7658ccb159bab, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The inspection manual recommends remotely restarting the unit and launching
      the partner-repair module. That significantly reduces the projected risk.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40f2eacb8afcb864ab3bd08a1186f9fc, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keeping the unit offline is also permitted. Ben and Claire would handle
      the next several days themselves, but comparable cases show a lower stabilization
      rate.
    holdSeconds: 10.5839615
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5262c3213163f03489fe22d02381f06b, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro_FieldUnit_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Select a disposition, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a5d7ad314f2af4540933f1aec5ca66ab, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
